  "remarks": "Renard Kutkovsky is the Deputy Head of the Administration of the City of Yalta in the so-called “Republic of Crimea”, Ukraine, overseeing education, culture, and youth policy. Previously, Renard Kutkovsky was the Head of the Department of Education and Youth Policy, helping to shape local education governance. In his official capacity within the occupation administration, Renard Kutkovsky promotes Russian state-sponsored patriotic events portraying Russia’s actions as legitimate and endorses narratives aligned with Russian state policy. Renard Kutkovsky implements decisions adopted under Russian federal and regional frameworks.",
